# Official Server Model Benchmark & Diagnostic Report

**Matchup `001_006` (Kamen Rider Ichigo vs. Kamen Rider Amazon)**

**Candidate Checkpoint Fingerprint:** `240124900`

**Engine Build:** `v5-state256-action17`

**Dataset Scale:** Candidate (13,786 games / 138,591 decisions) vs Active (11,764 games / 119,390 decisions)

**Deployment Target:** `data/models/001_006.json`

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Clearance Profile

Candidate Model **`240124900`** achieves a full pass across all difficulty tiers. Amazon is an explosive, high-mobility brawler with wild special setups, leading to the fastest match durations in the entire `001` series (~8.8 to 12.1 rounds).

Despite Amazon's hyper-aggressive pressure, Ichigo's retrained Q-priors utilize `A+I` Windmill Omni Guards for heavy Chi refunds and `D+L` frame-traps to secure positive win margins up through **SOUL Tier search lookahead**.

```
  ==================================================================================
   DIFFICULTY TIER     POLICY MODE     WIN RATE    SAMPLE    AVG ROUNDS    STATUS
  ==================================================================================
   EASY TIER          network (Direct)   77.3%     88 Games     9.8        PASSED
