## 4. Combat Style & Archetype Analysis: Ichigo vs. Amazon (`001_006`)

This matchup defines a unique dynamic within the 36-matrix project:

```
[ Amazon Wild Leaping Attack ] ──> [ D+L Interrupt OR A+I Windmill Omni Guard ]
                                                      │
[ Win (54.5% SOUL / 58.8% Master) ] <── [ S+J Heavy Punish (66.3% share) ]

```

### Archetype Profile: High-Tempo Counter-Brawling

* **Fastest Matchup Pace:** Compared to the extended 26–28 round attrition battles against Nigo (`001_002`) and V3 (`001_003`), Amazon's feral toolkit compresses rounds to **~11.8 rounds in SOUL tier**.
* **Anti-Rushdown Neutral:** Ichigo doesn't need to stall or out-heal Amazon (`W` stance is only 3.1% in SOUL); instead, success relies on **stuffing Amazon's forward movement** with `D+L` (107 uses in SOUL) and capitalizing on Amazon's high-risk whiffs.

