Archetype Profile: Feral Speed Brawler vs. Heavy Tank
 * Hyper-Fast Match Pacing: Amazon exhibits the fastest round execution time in the entire 36-matchup grid, averaging 9.7 to 12.0 rounds per match. This bypasses the prolonged 26–28 round attrition battles seen in heavyweight matchups (e.g., 001_001 or 001_003).
 * Spatial Evasion over Turtle Guarding: Rather than holding A+I Omni Guard, Amazon's matrix leverages high movement speed (W+I) and long-reaching low sweeps (D+K / D+L) to strip Ichigo's Chi and punish whiffs instantly.
